#NEXUS

[ Averianov & Sues 2021, PLOS ONE 16(2): e0246620, Fig. 4: part of the strict consensus, Rebbachisauridae, a slanted cladogram with GC support values at the nodes; 11 tips. 11 tips, drawn with oblique joining lines. The figure prints "Rayososaurus agrionensis" and "Dzharatitanis kingi"; the matrix has Rayososaurus_agrioensis and Dzharatitanis. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node against the image (2026-10-27); topology only, no support values. Licence: CC0 1.0; see attribution.txt. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=11;
    TAXLABELS
        Amazonsaurus_maranhensis
        Zapalasaurus_bonapartei
        Histriasaurus_bocardeli
        Comahuesaurus_windhanseni
        Rayososaurus_agrioensis
        Rebbachisaurus_garasbae
        Demandasaurus_darwini
        Nigersaurus_taqueti
        Dzharatitanis
        Cathartesaura_anaerobica
        Limaysaurus_tessonei
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE averianov2021b_fig4 = [&R] (Amazonsaurus_maranhensis,(Zapalasaurus_bonapartei,Histriasaurus_bocardeli,(Comahuesaurus_windhanseni,(Rayososaurus_agrioensis,Rebbachisaurus_garasbae,Demandasaurus_darwini,Nigersaurus_taqueti,Dzharatitanis,(Cathartesaura_anaerobica,Limaysaurus_tessonei)))));
END;
